From: Zephyr 4.4 / SDK 1.0.1 port
Subject: [PATCH] libmicroros: define _POSIX_MONOTONIC_CLOCK for picolibc's
 clock guards

SDK 1.0.1's picolibc guards the POSIX.1b clock constants behind
"#if defined(_POSIX_MONOTONIC_CLOCK)" in <time.h> — a plain option
macro that neither the default visibility nor _POSIX_C_SOURCE defines
(verified empirically: a bare probe fails on CLOCK_MONOTONIC, and so
does one with -D_POSIX_C_SOURCE=200809L).

rcutils src/time_unix.c needs CLOCK_MONOTONIC; previously it compiled
only because the Zephyr POSIX System Interfaces umbrella exported this
macro app-wide (-D_POSIX_MONOTONIC_CLOCK=200809L from
lib/posix/options) — a config we deliberately dropped because its
app-wide -I include/zephyr/posix header routing shadows the libc's
POSIX headers. Define the macro here instead, with the same name and
value Zephyr's own POSIX options use, scoped to the colcon C flags.

4.4-workspace only: on the NCS tree the real (pre-4.4)
zephyr/posix/time.h defines CLOCK_MONOTONIC itself, and applying this
define there would collide.

The clock_gettime()/nanosleep()/usleep() implementations the app
links against live in the tikk app repo (src/posix_clock.c).

Signed-off-by: Hermes (for Chris Gammell)

--- a/modules/libmicroros/libmicroros.mk
+++ b/modules/libmicroros/libmicroros.mk
@@ -30,6 +30,15 @@ CFLAGS_INTERNAL := -D__STDC_WANT_LIB_EXT1__=1 $(CFLAGS_INTERNAL)
 CXXFLAGS_INTERNAL := -Drestrict=__restrict__ $(CXXFLAGS_INTERNAL)
 
+# picolibc hides the POSIX.1b clock constants (CLOCK_MONOTONIC etc.)
+# behind #if defined(_POSIX_MONOTONIC_CLOCK) — a plain option macro that
+# neither default visibility nor _POSIX_C_SOURCE defines. rcutils'
+# time_unix.c needs CLOCK_MONOTONIC; this mirrors the macro Zephyr's own
+# POSIX options export (same name and value). 4.4-workspace only: on the
+# NCS tree the real zephyr/posix/time.h defines CLOCK_MONOTONIC itself
+# and this define would collide.
+CFLAGS_INTERNAL := -D_POSIX_MONOTONIC_CLOCK=200809L $(CFLAGS_INTERNAL)
+
 CFLAGS_INTERNAL := -c -I$(COMPONENT_PATH)/zephyr_compat -I$(ZEPHYR_BASE)/include/posix -I$(PROJECT_BINARY_DIR)/include/generated $(CFLAGS_INTERNAL)
 CXXFLAGS_INTERNAL := -c -I$(COMPONENT_PATH)/zephyr_compat -I$(ZEPHYR_BASE)/include/posix -I$(PROJECT_BINARY_DIR)/include/generated $(CXXFLAGS_INTERNAL)